---
title: Hot Honey
description: Chilli-infused honey for drizzling.
image: "[[Attachments/Recipes/hot-honey.svg]]"
servings: 6
course: sauce
prep time: 2 min
cook time: 5 min
tags: [sauce, sweet, spicy]
---
Warm @honey{120%g} with @chilli flakes{1%tsp} and @apple cider vinegar{1%tsp} in a #small pan{} for ~{5%minutes}, without letting it boil.

Strain it, or leave the flakes in for more heat.
